flowchart TD
    Start([API Invoked]) --> Validate
    Validate{Input Valid?}
    Validate -->|No| Error1[Throw Validation Error]
    Validate -->|Yes| Process
    Process --> Check1{Condition: InvoiceAmount  LTE  0}
    Check1 -->|Yes| Rule1[InvoiceAmount_less]
    Check1 -->|No| Next1[Continue]
    Next1 --> Check2{Condition: InvoiceDate  LT}
    Check2 -->|Yes| Rule2[InvoiceDate_less]
    Check2 -->|No| Next2[Continue]
    Next2 --> Check3{Condition: String.IsNullOrWhiteSpace}
    Check3 -->|Yes| Rule3[String_IsNullOrWhite]
    Check3 -->|No| Next3[Continue]
    Next3 --> DB[Database Operations]
    DB --> Complete
    Complete([Operation Complete])
    Error1 --> End([End])
    Complete --> End([End])
